<</Title(A population-based multi-agent approach for simulating large-scale system dynamics in discrete environments)/Subject<>/Keywords(simulation, cellular automata, multi-agent systems, evolution, population dynamics)/Author(Tim Peko)/Creator(Typst 0.15.0)/ModDate(D:20260821201639+02'00)/CreationDate(D:20260821201639+02'00)>>
